1
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:07,940
Cosquinha de monstrinho…

2
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:10,180
Quem aguenta?

3
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,320
Fofolucos! Rawr!

4
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,100
Lá na Vila Monstrinha

5
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:26,260
Tem segredo pra contar:

6
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:28,480
Todo mundo tem um cantinho

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,620
Que faz o monstrinho gargalhar!

8
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:33,120
O Bilu tem no chifrinho,

9
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:35,190
O Gogo, na anteninha,

10
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,380
A Mimi, no pelinho,

11
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,680
E o Nhoque… na barriguinha!

12
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:41,973
Cosquinha, cosquinha!

13
00:00:41,993 --> 00:00:43,740
Quem aguenta? Ninguém!

14
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:46,260
Cosquinha, cosquinha!

15
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,200
Monstrinho ri também!

16
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:50,820
Cosquinha, cosquinha!

17
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,600
Quem aguenta? Ninguém!

18
00:00:52,620 --> 00:00:55,020
Rá-rá-rá! Rawr!

19
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:57,300
Cosquinha de monstrinho!

20
00:00:57,320 --> 00:01:00,060
Fofolucos! Rawr!

21
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:01,220
Fofolucos!

22
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:14,680
Tenta fazer cosquinha em você!

23
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:17,020
Não dá! Não dá!

24
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:19,480
Só funciona com um amiguinho!

25
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:21,960
Mexe o pezinho! Balança a barriga!

26
00:01:21,980 --> 00:01:23,140
Levanta o bracinho!

27
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:24,720
Cuti-cuti-cuti-cuti!

28
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,320
Rá-rá-rá! Rawr!

29
00:01:26,340 --> 00:01:30,320
O Zuzu fez cara séria:

30
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:32,280
"Cosquinha em mim? Não dá!"

31
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:34,540
Tentaram pena, tentaram pincel…

32
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:36,660
E o Zuzu nem quis olhar!

33
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:38,960
Mas pousou uma mosquinha

34
00:01:38,980 --> 00:01:41,220
Bem na ponta do chifrinho…

35
00:01:41,240 --> 00:01:43,380
O Zuzu riu tanto, tanto,

36
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:45,360
Que rolou pelo caminho!

37
00:01:45,380 --> 00:01:47,780
Cosquinha, cosquinha!

38
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:49,660
Quem aguenta? Ninguém!

39
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:52,140
Cosquinha, cosquinha!

40
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:54,020
Monstrinho ri também!

41
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:56,520
Cosquinha, cosquinha!

42
00:01:56,540 --> 00:01:58,400
Quem aguenta? Ninguém!

43
00:01:58,420 --> 00:02:00,660
Rá-rá-rá! Rawr!

44
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:03,440
Cosquinha de monstrinho!

45
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:22,720
Cosquinha, cosquinha!

46
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:24,600
Quem aguenta? Ninguém!

47
00:02:24,620 --> 00:02:27,120
Cosquinha, cosquinha!

48
00:02:27,140 --> 00:02:29,140
Monstrinho ri também!

49
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:31,580
Faz cosquinha no papai!

50
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:33,400
E na mamãe!

51
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:35,080
Dá um joinha!

52
00:02:35,100 --> 00:02:37,460
Chama o papai e a mamãe

53
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:40,080
Pra se inscrever no canal! Rawr!

54
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:46,450
Fofolucos! Tchau! Rawr!
